Finally, since $\angle POQ = 180^\circ$, $\angle OQP = 2 \cdot \angle QPO = 360^\circ - \angle OQP = 360^\circ - 2 \cdot \angle QPO = 360^\circ - \angle QPO = \boxed{146^\circ}$.

